@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Greeting: Card Inserted
Greeting --> PIN Entry: Timer/Default
PIN Entry --> PIN Incorrect: PIN Incorrect
PIN Entry --> Options Display: PIN Correct
PIN Incorrect --> PIN Entry: Try Again
PIN Incorrect --> Card Retained: Incorrect PIN Limit Reached
Options Display --> Processing: Choice Made
PIN Entry --> Card Retained: Cancel
Options Display --> Card Retained: Cancel
Card Retained --> [*]
Processing --> [*]: Processing Complete
@enduml
